From debadfe40ccb225623def3faacbe3185782190f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tzeentchnet <58480142+Tzeentchnet@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:43:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] perf: retain split VIF1 payloads without recopying

---
 ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_vif1_interpreter.cpp | 12 ++++++++++--
